    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_008_master_cancel",
      "hash64": "A65424BE9F55C27C",
      "text": "……有需要時再來找我吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_008_master_04",
      "hash64": "800BDB4176DADE02",
      "text": "嗯？看[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好像沒有金色王冠\\n也沒有銀色王冠啊。",
